<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ZapaShop - Encuentra tu Estilo</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/sweetalert2@11"></script>

<style>
    /* ======================================================= */
    /* --- ZAPASHOP: UNIFICACIÓN DE ESTILOS Y COLORES NEÓN --- */
    /* ======================================================= */

    /* Fondo general oscuro y elegante */
    body {
        background-color: #0b132b !important;
        color: #f8fafc !important;
        font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    }

    /* Barra de navegación superior */
    nav {
        background-color: #070d1f !important;
        border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4) !important;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5) !important;
    }

    nav a, nav span {
        color: #ffffff !important;
        font-weight: 800 !important;
    }

    nav a:hover {
        color: #f472b6 !important;
    }

    /* Tarjetas de productos, contenedores del carrito y formularios de envío */
    .bg-white, #productsGrid > div, .card-custom, div.bg-slate-800, div.bg-slate-900, .cart-item-container {
        background-color: #161f33 !important; /* Tono azul medianoche exacto de tus vistas */
        border: 2px solid #3b306b !important; /* Borde lila/morado sutil de las tarjetas */
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6) !important;
        color: #ffffff !important;
        border-radius: 1.2rem !important;
        transition: all 0.3s ease !important;
    }

    /* Efecto al pasar el cursor sobre las tarjetas o el resumen */
    #productsGrid > div:hover, .card-custom:hover {
        border-color: #d946ef !important; /* Se enciende en fucsia al hacer hover */
        box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(217, 70, 239, 0.25) !important;
        transform: translateY(-3px);
    }

    /* Botones principales de acción y "Confirmar Pedido" (Degradado Fucsia/Rosa) */
    a.bg-blue-600, button.bg-blue-600, .bg-blue-600, button.bg-gradient-to-r, .btn-primary {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f43f5e 0%, #d946ef 100%) !important;
        color: #ffffff !important;
        font-weight: 900 !important;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(217, 70, 239, 0.4) !important;
        border: none !important;
        border-radius: 9999px !important;
        transition: all 0.3s ease !important;
    }

    a.bg-blue-600:hover, button.bg-blue-600:hover {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fb7185 0%, #ec4899 100%) !important;
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.55) !important;
    }

    /* Tipografía y textos claros */
    h1, h2, h3, h4, .text-slate-900, .text-white {
        color: #ffffff !important;
        font-weight: 900 !important;
    }

    p, .text-slate-400, .text-slate-500, .text-slate-600 {
        color: #94a3b8 !important;
        font-weight: 600 !important;
    }

    /* Inputs, selectores de talla y campos del carrito */
    input, select {
        background-color: #0b132b !important;
        border: 2px solid #3b306b !important;
        color: #ffffff !important;
        border-radius: 0.75rem !important;
    }

    input:focus, select:focus {
        border-color: #d946ef !important;
        outline: none !important;
    }
</style>


    <!-- ESTILOS HALLOWEEN HIGH-VIBRANCY (ACTIVADOS POR EL ADMIN) -->
<style>
    /* ======================================================= */
    /* --- ZAPASHOP: HALLOWEEN ULTRA IMMERSIVE --- */
    /* ======================================================= */

    body.halloween-mode {
        background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, #3b0712 0%, #120205 50%, #030001 100%) !important;
        color: #f3f4f6 !important;
    }

    /* Decoración tétrica superior en el Index / Banner Principal */
    body.halloween-mode .hero-section::after,
    body.halloween-mode header::after {
        content: "🦇  ¡EDICIÓN ESPECIAL DE TERROR - HALLOWEEN SALE!  🦇";
        display: block;
        text-align: center;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ea580c, #9333ea, #ea580c);
        color: #ffffff;
        font-weight: 900;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        padding: 6px;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
        animation: pulseGlow 2s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulseGlow {
        0% { opacity: 0.8; }
        50% { opacity: 1; text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.9); }
        100% { opacity: 0.8; }
    }

    /* Tarjetas del catálogo con detalles de calabaza y calavera flotantes */
    body.halloween-mode #productsGrid > div, 
    body.halloween-mode .card-custom {
        background: linear-gradient(145deg, #180306 0%, #090002 100%) !important;
        border: 2px solid #ea580c !important;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.3), inset 0 0 20px rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.15) !important;
        position: relative;
    }

    /* Distintivo dinámico de temporada en las tarjetas */
    body.halloween-mode #productsGrid > div::before {
        content: "🎃";
        position: absolute;
        top: 10px;
        left: 10px;
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        z-index: 10;
        filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px #ea580c);
    }

    body.halloween-mode #productsGrid > div::after {
        content: "👻";
        position: absolute;
        top: 10px;
        right: 10px;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        z-index: 10;
        opacity: 0.8;
    }

    /* Efecto hover con fuego espectral y elevación */
    body.halloween-mode #productsGrid > div:hover, 
    body.halloween-mode .card-custom:hover {
        border-color: #c084fc !important;
        box-shadow: 0 22px 45px rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.4), 0 0 30px rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.6) !important;
        transform: translateY(-6px) scale(1.02);
    }

    /* Barra de navegación con atmósfera nocturna intensa */
    body.halloween-mode nav {
        background-color: #090002 !important;
        border-bottom: 2px solid #ea580c !important;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 30px rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.4) !important;
    }

    /* Botones de acción con estilo de poción mágica / fuego */
    body.halloween-mode a.bg-blue-600, 
    body.halloween-mode button.bg-blue-600, 
    body.halloween-mode .bg-blue-600, 
    body.halloween-mode button.bg-gradient-to-r,
    body.halloween-mode .btn-primary {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c2410c 0%, #7e22ce 100%) !important;
        color: #ffffff !important;
        font-weight: 900 !important;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(194, 65, 12, 0.7) !important;
        border: 1px solid #fdba74 !important;
    }

    body.halloween-mode a.bg-blue-600:hover, 
    body.halloween-mode button.bg-blue-600:hover {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ea580c 0%, #a855f7 100%) !important;
        box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.8) !important;
        transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    /* Textos y títulos con resplandor tenebroso */
    body.halloween-mode h1, 
    body.halloween-mode h2, 
    body.halloween-mode h3, 
    body.halloween-mode h4 {
        color: #ffffff !important;
        text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.6);
    }

    body.halloween-mode p, 
    body.halloween-mode .text-slate-400, 
    body.halloween-mode .text-slate-500 {
        color: #fed7aa !important;
    }
</style>


</head>

<body class="bg-white text-slate-900 font-sans">

<nav class="bg-white border-b border-slate-100 sticky top-0 z-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 h-20 flex justify-between items-center">
        <!-- Logo -->
        <a href="/" class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-black text-blue-600 tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
            <div class="bg-blue-600 p-2 rounded-lg text-white">
                <i data-lucide="shopping-bag" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
            </div>
            <span>ZapaShop</span>
        </a>

        <!-- Enlaces Escritorio -->
        <div class="hidden md:flex gap-8 font-bold text-sm text-slate-600">
            <a href="/" class="text-blue-600 border-b-2 border-blue-600">Inicio</a>
            <a href="/catalogo" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Catálogo</a>
            <a href="/#nosotros" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Nosotros</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Acciones Derecha -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            {{#if user}}
                <div class="hidden sm:flex items-center gap-1.5 mr-1">
                    <i data-lucide="user" class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400"></i>
                    <span class="text-xs md:text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 truncate">
                        {{user.username}}
                    </span>
                </div>
            {{else}}
                <div class="hidden sm:flex items-center gap-2">
                    <a href="/perfil" class="text-xs md:text-sm font-black text-slate-700 hover:text-blue-600 px-1">Entrar</a>
                    <a href="/perfil" class="bg-blue-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-black transition-all">
                        Unirse
                    </a>
                </div>
            {{/if}}

            <!-- Carrito -->
            <a href="/carrito" class="relative group p-2">
                <i data-lucide="shopping-cart" class="w-6 h-6 text-slate-700"></i>
                <span id="cart-count" class="cart-count absolute -top-1 -right-1 bg-blue-600 text-white text-[10px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-full">0</span>
            </a>

            <!-- Hamburguesa Móvil -->
            <button id="btnHamburguesa" class="md:hidden p-2 text-slate-700 hover:text-blue-600 focus:outline-none cursor-pointer">
                <i data-lucide="menu" class="w-7 h-7"></i>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="menuMovilDesplegable" class="hidden md:hidden bg-white border-t border-slate-100 px-6 py-4 space-y-3 font-bold text-sm text-slate-700 shadow-xl transition-all">
        <a href="/" class="block text-blue-600 py-1 border-b border-slate-50">🏠 Inicio</a>
        <a href="/catalogo" class="block hover:text-blue-600 py-1 border-b border-slate-50">👟 Catálogo</a>
        <a href="/carrito" class="block hover:text-blue-600 py-1 border-b border-slate-50">🛒 Mi Carrito</a>
        <a href="/perfil" class="block hover:text-blue-600 py-1">👤 Mi Perfil / Cuenta</a>
    </div>
</nav>

<header class="relative h-[500px] flex items-center justify-center text-center text-white bg-slate-900">
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552346154-21d32810aba3?q=80&w=2070" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-40 mix-blend-luminosity" alt="Background">
    <div class="relative z-10 px-4">
        <h1 class="text-5xl font-black mb-4 uppercase tracking-tighter">CAMINA CON <br> <span class="text-blue-500">ESTILO Y PODER</span></h1>
        <p class="max-w-lg mx-auto text-slate-300 mb-8 text-sm">Descubre la colección más exclusiva de sneakers y botas. Diseñados para quienes no temen destacar en cada paso.</p>
        <div class="flex justify-center gap-4">
            <a href="/catalogo" class="bg-blue-600 px-8 py-3 rounded-md font-bold hover:bg-fuchsia-600 transition shadow-lg hover:shadow-fuchsia-600/40">Ver Catálogo</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</header>

<section class="py-16 card-halloween bg-slate-900 text-white my-12 rounded-[3rem] mx-4 overflow-hidden relative shadow-2xl">
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-10 opacity-10">
        <i data-lucide="map-pin" class="w-64 h-64"></i>
    </div>
    
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-8 relative z-10">
        <div class="mb-10 text-center lg:text-left">
            <h2 class="text-4xl font-black mb-2 flex items-center gap-3 justify-center lg:justify-start">
                Nuestras Tiendas
            </h2>
            <p class="text-slate-400">Visítanos y pruébate tus ZapaShop favoritos en persona.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6" id="contenedorTiendas">
            <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 p-6 rounded-3xl hover:bg-white/10 transition shadow-lg">
                <div class="bg-blue-600 w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-white">
                    <i data-lucide="map-pin"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-1">ZapaShop Centro</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Av. Principal #123, Col. Centro. CP 06000.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 p-6 rounded-3xl hover:bg-white/10 transition shadow-lg">
                <div class="bg-blue-600 w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-white">
                    <i data-lucide="map-pin"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-1">ZapaShop Norte</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Plaza Las Torres, Local 45. Nivel 1.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 p-6 rounded-3xl hover:bg-white/10 transition shadow-lg">
                <div class="bg-blue-600 w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 text-white">
                    <i data-lucide="map-pin"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-1">ZapaShop Poniente</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Calzada de los Héroes #890. Frente al parque.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="nosotros" class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
            <h1 class="text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-2">Sobre Nosotros</h1>
            <p class="text-slate-500 font-medium">Más de 20 años llevando estilo y comodidad a tus pies</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center mb-20">
            <div class="space-y-6">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900">Nuestra Historia</h2>
                <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                    ZapaShop nació en 2006 con un sueño simple: ofrecer zapatos de calidad excepcional que combinen estilo, comodidad y durabilidad. Lo que comenzó como una pequeña tienda familiar en el centro de la ciudad, se ha convertido en una cadena de sucursales reconocida por su excelencia.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-600 to-purple-500 rounded-[2rem] p-10 text-white shadow-2xl shadow-indigo-200 border border-purple-500/30">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8">
                    <div class="flex flex-col">
                        <span class="text-4xl font-black">20+</span>
                        <span class="text-indigo-100 font-medium">Años de experiencia</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col">
                        <span class="text-4xl font-black">3</span>
                        <span class="text-indigo-100 font-medium">Sucursales en CDMX</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<footer class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-400 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
        <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
                <i data-lucide="shopping-bag" class="text-blue-500"></i>
                <span class="text-white font-bold text-xl">ZapaShop</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm">La mejor experiencia en compra de calzado online. Calidad, estilo y rapidez en un solo lugar.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="text-center mt-12 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest border-t border-white/5 pt-8">
        © 2026 ZapaShop. Hecho Por Universitarios del Tecnologico de Iztapalapa.
    </div>
</footer>

<script src="/app.js"></script>
<script src="/accesibilidad.js"></script>
<script>
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
        if (window.lucide) lucide.createIcons();
    });
</script>
</body>
</html>
